    "title": "Selma Housing Authority receives 93% score from HUD - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nathan Prewett ,\n8 hours ago The Selma Housing Authority (SHA) received a 93% Section 8 Management Assessment Program (SEMAP) score from the U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development. In an announcement on Wednesday, SHA stated that the score was given based on the administration of the Housing Choice Voucher Program (Section 8) to families in Dallas, Wilcox and Clarke counties. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
